From: Kristjan Sillmann <kristjan.h.s@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:39:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] pc-voice

vic-anim TTS provider (B4.2, R15-R18): each line reads /data/data/myvector-voice.json
{url, voice, slow}; missing/bad file, no url or voice stock speaks Acapela unchanged. Otherwise
each sentence is one HTTP/1.0 POST /tts to the PC service (slow = file slow x durationScalar,
clamped 0.5-2.0; 1.5 s to the first response byte), its 16 kHz PCM resampled to Acapela's rate
because a stream keeps its first chunk's rate. A failed sentence and the rest of the line speak
in Acapela (R17). Logs my-vector.Voice.
---
 .../textToSpeechProvider_vicos.cpp            | 265 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../textToSpeech/textToSpeechProvider_vicos.h |  15 +
 2 files changed, 280 insertions(+)

